  m_text: "HOW TO PLAY\n\nWelcome to the game!\n\nWASD \u2014 move the player.\n\nSPACE \u2014 jump.\n\nCollect all the coins on the map.\n\nWhen you collect all coins, you win the level.\n\nUse the Settings menu to change your player name.\n\nYou can also change the player colour.\n\nFullscreen mode can be enabled or disabled.\n\nMusic can be turned on or off.\n\nUse the mouse wheel to scroll through these instructions.\n\nGood luck and have fun!"
